abstract: >-
  A universal exact reconstruction theorem for three-dimensional proper-zero
  reflected-cap raw unions, proved by oriented frontier-ridge propagation and
  site-anchored strict-component recovery. The companion package includes an
  auxiliary intrinsic signature algorithm, exact polynomial certificates,
  and independent local and global exact-rational falsification audits.
